  md7fa65fb6906 "(*) Effective dates and sources for numerical indicators"
  mda95a3f8e008 "Repository, language, package and community figures are dated snapshots, not live counters. Calendar and article cards can refresh from public services; otherwise their displayed effective date applies. The calendar service caches GitHub data for up to one hour; conflicting results keep the saved GitHub graph. Career durations are calculated today. Dates in the career record describe the events themselves."
  m7beccb866795 "Only public source repositories are counted. The calendar also includes anonymized private activity shared on the GitHub profile. No private repository names, languages or source code are collected."
