  mcdc1470065ca "Universal problem solving algorithm"
  mc4ad5a8cdd3a "Every project here is built the same way: decompose the problem, experiment against tests, select what passes and compose it back. The algorithm is recursive and applies to itself, so it produces plans, algorithms and better requirements as well as solutions."
